## 6. Expiration of Senior Design Rights

The limited license granted under Section 2 exists only for purposes of the applicable UC Senior Design project.

An Authorized Team Member's rights under Section 2 terminate automatically upon the earliest of:

1. completion or conclusion of the applicable UC Senior Design project;
2. the Authorized Team Member leaving or being removed from the Senior Design team;
3. the Authorized Team Member no longer requiring access for UC Senior Design; or
4. revocation of access by Jacob Cohen where such revocation is consistent with applicable UC Senior Design requirements.

Upon termination, the individual has no continuing license to use the Project except to the extent separately authorized in writing by the then-current rights holder.

Termination of the limited license does not affect any assignment, ownership provision, confidentiality obligation, restriction concerning prior unauthorized use, or other provision intended by its nature to survive termination.

